---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="The Universal Law of Agency"
  description="About: The Universal Law of Agency. An OpenIE research track. Law first, kinematics second, intelligence as the calculus of agency in joules."
>
  <section class="px-6 md:px-10 pt-16 md:pt-24 pb-20 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
    <p class="section-label mb-4">Research track · about</p>
    <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-brand-white tracking-tight">
      The Universal Law of Agency
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-6 font-body text-base text-brand-slate leading-relaxed">
      This is David Charlot's proposal, in three layers. The Universal Law of Agency comes first, and it is required. Nothing is an agent until the law is met.
      The kinematic laws follow. They bound how fast agency moves per second and per joule.
      Intelligence is the calculus of agency. It is a hindsight characteristic, read off a completed run the way velocity is read off a recorded path. It is a derivative of agency in joules.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-4 font-body text-base text-brand-slate leading-relaxed">
      Energy to run is the only true metric of computer intelligence. All other factors collapse to zero.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-4 font-body text-sm text-brand-gray leading-relaxed">
      A research track. Each layer sorts its sources into proven, demonstrated and opinion. Global findings are organized by method. Open problems and an experiment plan with a real meter close the track.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-8 glass-card p-6 space-y-2" id="companion-laws">
      <p class="font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[2px] uppercase text-brand-gray">Where the studies sit</p>
      <p class="font-body text-sm text-brand-slate leading-relaxed">
        <a href="/papers/mol/" class="text-brand-cyan">Mixture of Limits</a> is the philosophy and the optimum operator.
        <a href="/papers/ni/" class="text-brand-cyan">Notational Intelligence</a> is the receipt.
        <a href="/papers/mei/" class="text-brand-cyan">Metabolic Intelligence</a> is the product, on any fabric.
        Klere is the hardware that meters joules.
        See <a href="/#universal-law-of-agency" class="text-brand-cyan">the catalog strip</a>.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
      <a href="/papers/agency/" class="inline-flex font-mono text-xs text-brand-dark bg-brand-amber px-4 py-2.5 rounded-md no-underline hover:bg-brand-gold transition-colors">
        Read paper → /papers/agency/
      </a>
      <a href="/pdfs/agency.pdf" class="inline-flex font-mono text-xs text-brand-amber border border-brand-amber/40 px-4 py-2.5 rounded-md no-underline hover:bg-brand-amber/10 transition-colors" download>
        Download PDF
      </a>
      <a href="/living/" class="inline-flex font-mono text-xs text-brand-cyan border border-brand-cyan/30 px-4 py-2.5 rounded-md no-underline hover:bg-brand-cyan/10 transition-colors">
        Figures hub
      </a>
      <a href="/" class="inline-flex font-mono text-xs text-brand-slate border border-brand-border px-4 py-2.5 rounded-md no-underline hover:text-brand-white transition-colors">
        ← Catalog
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 glass-card p-6 space-y-3">
      <p class="font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[2px] uppercase text-brand-gray">Paths</p>
      <p class="font-mono text-xs text-brand-slate"><span class="text-brand-cyan">/papers/agency/</span> → track prose</p>
      <p class="font-mono text-xs text-brand-slate"><span class="text-brand-cyan">/pdfs/agency.pdf</span> → downloadable track PDF (regenerate via scripts/generate-pdfs.sh)</p>
      <p class="font-mono text-xs text-brand-slate"><span class="text-brand-cyan">/about/agency/</span> → this page</p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-8 glass-card p-6 space-y-2">
      <p class="font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[2px] uppercase text-brand-gray">Measurement bounds</p>
      <p class="font-body text-sm text-brand-slate leading-relaxed">
        Theorems, experiments and positions are cited from their sources. Estimates are never measured_j. No board power is claimed.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
